muros (0.9.63) trixie; urgency=medium

  * PPTP: sessions run under pppd like PPPoE, with the pptp helper handed to
    pppd as its terminal, a default MTU accounting for the GRE and IP headers
    and EAP refused since a PPTP server offering it cannot be authenticated
