muros (0.9.58) trixie; urgency=medium

  * IPv6 WAN: finish the port. An interface in slaac mode was rendered with
    IPv6AcceptRA=no, so the kernel ignored the router advertisements and the
    interface never got an address, and interface_dhcpv6_configure() still
    started rtsold, which does not exist on Debian and was the only thing
